## Gate ontology and mapping AI routes

Context: Ontology and Mapping LLM entry points used serving-only or inline
endpoint checks. They now share the domain-level LLM guard, and SQL generation
uses the saved domain target instead of request overrides.

Changes:

1. src/api/routers/internal/ontology.py
   Migrate ontology generation, icon assignment, and assistant routes to the
   domain-level LLM guard before starting work, and force assistant invoke to
   use the saved endpoint.
2. src/api/routers/internal/mapping.py
   Guard SQL and auto-assignment routes and make the saved endpoint authoritative.
3. src/back/core/sqlwizard/SQLWizardService.py
   Route saved endpoint kinds through the Gateway/Serving request builder.
